ntent": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Le petit quotidien", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "\u00c0 quelle heure te l\u00e8ves-tu ?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "Beginner", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Les expressions de la fr\u00e9quence et de l'habitude", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">La fr\u00e9quence</span> est le nombre d'occurrences d'un \u00e9v\u00e8nement. <span class=\"strong\">L'habitude</span> est le comportement qu'on adopte de fa\u00e7on r\u00e9guli\u00e8re, voire machinale, dans la vie de tous les jours. Le tableau ci-dessous liste les diff\u00e9rentes expressions de la fr\u00e9quence et de l'habitude&nbsp;:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Expression</span> </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Exemple</span> </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"toujours/tous les jours/tous les samedis, week-ends, matins, etc.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Il est toujours en retard.</br> Elle joue au tennis tous les samedis.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"chaque jour, matin, soir, week-end, etc.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Ils font la grasse matin\u00e9e chaque week-end.</br>Elle prend du th\u00e9 chaque matin.</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"jamais\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Il ne boit jamais d'alcool.<span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"souvent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Il parle souvent \u00e0 son ex-femme.</br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"quelquefois/de temps en temps/parfois\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Elle sort toute seule de temps en temps.</br> Quelquefois, je pense \u00e0 apprendre l'italien.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rarement/presque jamais\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Ils ne se voient presque jamais.</br> Il me parle rarement de sa famille.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"d'habitude/habituellement/g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement/ordinairement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Je prends g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement le train.</br>D'habitude, Julie n'arrive pas \u00e0 l'heure.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tous les deux, trois, quatre, etc. mois</br>Toutes les deux, trois, quatre, etc. semaines\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">On part en vacances tous les six mois.</br> Je vais \u00e0 la piscine toutes les deux semaines.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"une, deux, trois, etc. fois par jour/semaine/mois/an.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Nous faisons les courses deux fois par mois. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "crev\u00e9, crev\u00e9e", "type": "name"}, {"content": "tr\u00e8s fatigu\u00e9 ; \u00e9puis\u00e9", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Julie est crev\u00e9e apr\u00e8s une longue journ\u00e9e au boulot.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le04ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous entendez dans le dialogue.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "trop", "type": "name"}, {"content": "indique l'exc\u00e8s ou un degr\u00e9 \u00e9lev\u00e9 ; tr\u00e8s ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il mange trop pendant la f\u00eate.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le04ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "quitter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "sortir d'un lieu ; abandonner", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je quitte ma maison \u00e0 8h00.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le04ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "parfois", "type": "name"}, {"content": "des fois ; de temps \u00e0 autre", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Parfois, j'aime aller au resto japonais.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le04ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le trajet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "le chemin ; l'itin\u00e9raire", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Combien de temps dure le trajet de Nice \u00e0 Paris ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le04ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "presque", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pas tout \u00e0 fait ; environ ; \u00e0 peu pr\u00e8s", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : I